  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAPID CARE: Rapid Assistance Program for Integration of Displaced Children in Armenia for Resilience and Empowermen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective(s): The overall objective of the action is to facilitate the integration of forcibly displaced Armenians from Nagorno Karabakh, focusing on children and youth and their families, into Armenian society. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective(s): High-quality education, psychosocial support, and healthcare services to empower displaced youth and families and foster resilience and societal contribution &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
